{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEVOSE is a co-op horror game for up to 4 players. Your objective: investigate abandoned laboratories, identify a mutant creature, synthesize an antidote\u2026 and survive long enough to deploy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here, nothing is handed to you. No HUD. No map. No respite. You'll have to figure out how everything works by <strong>exploring, deducing, and keeping your cool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent monster hunting</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster changes with each game. It has unique behaviors, mechanics, and weaknesses. Conduct a triple investigation: <strong>behavioral profile, abnormal abilities, and genetic signature.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player searches the databases? Another feeds the servers? A third searches for ingredients in the laboratories? Everyone has a vital role to play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 different environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 4 environments (X150P Labs, Bhor Station, 31st Street House, Arctic 4N71). Each environment has its own unique gameplay mechanics and varying difficulty levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One antidote, one chance</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature has a unique weakness. Find the right ingredients, assemble them... before it's too late.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No heavy tutorial, no intrusive HUD</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment speaks for itself. Devose encourages you to think, observe, and communicate.<br><br><br><strong>Demo Includes:</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one map 